     A*==============================================================
      * REPORT AUDIT DISCREPANCIES FILE
     A*==============================================================
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PAD01                     TEXT('AUDIT DISCREPANCY FILE')
     A            ADCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            ADFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            ADEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            ADDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            ADFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            ADRCYM         5  0       TEXT('CYM OF QFEUP')
     A            ADELWR    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUDITED' 'WDELP' 'PREMIUM')
     A            ADEUWR    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('TOTAL' 'CEU' 'WRITTEN')
     A            ADEUEA    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('TOTAL' 'CEU' 'EARNED')
     A            ADCODE         2          COLHDG('ERR CODE')
     A            ADERR         60          COLHDG('ERR MESSAGE')
